  "environment": "Brave Beta Chromium 156.0.8078.74, macOS, signed-in account, Polish UI; read-only through CDP, extension installed but not driven",
  "evidence": "Recorded host fixture (Hive player objects as the MAIN world reads them), not live extension verification",
  "notes": "Captured paused. NOT captured: the audio/subtitle menu (its button is not in disney-web-player's light DOM while the player UI is idle), playing/idle/clock progression, ads, an audio switch. Hive objects are summarised through a key filter that drops anything url/token/session/profile-like. User preference lists (audio.preferences, captions.preferences) are replaced by [\"en\"]. Caption files are fetched as WebVTT from the CDN (summarised in subtitleResources), not read from the player API. Note the clock: Hive's playhead (timeline.info.playheadPositionMs) and the content video's currentTime differ after a media reload, so the playhead is the content position.",
